        "original_id": "242a28bf-800a-5428-8d73-307c8fd67bc8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tom Clegg\n- Projects: Carry On franchise, Carry On Screaming!\n- Topics: British film and television acting\n\nFacts:\n- Tom Clegg was an English actor who lived from 1915 to 1996.\n- Tom Clegg had a number of small film and television roles during the 1950s, 1960s, and 1970s.\n- Tom Clegg is known for appearing in several Carry On films, especially Carry On Screaming!.\n- The Carry On franchise primarily consists of 31 low-budget British comedy films released from 1958 to 1992.\n- The Carry On franchise also includes four Christmas specials, a thirteen-episode television series, and three West End and provincial stage plays.",
